hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"151","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Subah ki dusri rak'at se sar uthate to yeh dua farmate: 'Ai Allah! Walid bin Walid, Salamah bin Hisham, Ayyash bin Abi Rabi'ah aur Makkah mein [qayd] kamzoron ko najat de. Ai Allah! [Qabile] Muzar par Apni pakad sakht farma, aur un par [qaht ke] aise saal bana jaise Yusuf wale saal [the].'"
"152","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Sirin (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik [Raziyallahu anhu] se qunut ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ruku ke ba'd qunut farmate."
"153","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim (Rahimahullah) se apne chacha [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se shikayat ki ke use namaz mein kuch [hawa kharij hone ka weham] mehsoos hota hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh [namaz se] na phire yahan tak ke bu pae ya aawaz sune.'"
